    "text": "Charge is distributed within a sphere of radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> with a volume charge density <math><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>a</mi></math> are constants. If <math><mi>Q</mi></math> is the total charge of this charge distribution, the radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> is:",
